B.M8=new A.fa("Prompt Engineering","AI agents \xb7 LLMs",B.Cv,B.Ay,"I use AI coding agents as part of my daily workflow: reusable skills that package instructions for recurring tasks, MCP servers that connect the agent to docs, browsers and other tools, and multi-agent prompting where sub-agents plan, build and review in parallel. I always check and test what they produce.",B.EV)
